      "The Formula 1 United States Grand Prix at Circuit of the Americas follows in late October or early November. COTA is located in southeast Austin, and properties in the eastern and south-central corridors see the strongest F1-driven demand. Race weekend rates for well-positioned STRs commonly run $600 to $1,500 per night.",
      "The combination of ACL and F1 in the same month makes October a genuinely exceptional revenue period — one that makes annual return projections significantly different from markets without comparable event calendars.",
